      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Registration and policy are configured privately by the user.",
        "No per-operation approval UI: configured scoped commands run unattended.",
        "Guest secrets are entered through private UI or the exact saved entry; never CLI arguments, environment, files or broker IPC.",
        "Machine-scoped host operations are distinct from per-VM guest operations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Evidence today",
      "items": [
        "Many bounded command variants have owner live observations; this is NOT 47 live passes or full variant parity. Some remain blocked or partial.",
